{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":45,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和华使塞鲁士兴起"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“我耶和华膏立塞鲁士为王，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我牵着他的右手帮助他征服列国、降服列王；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使城门洞开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再关闭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我对他说，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘我要走在你前面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为你夷平高山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"打破铜门，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"砍断铁闩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把隐藏的宝物和秘密收藏的财富赐给你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好叫你知道点名呼召你的是我——以色列的上帝耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然你不认识我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但为了我的仆人雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我所拣选的以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我还是点名呼召你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赐给你一个尊贵的名号。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是独一无二的耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外再没有上帝。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"虽然你不认识我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我还是赐你力量。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，从日出之地到日落之处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"普天下都知道除我以外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"别无他神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是独一无二的耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我造光明，也造黑暗；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"赐平安，也降灾祸。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这一切都是我耶和华的作为。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"“‘诸天啊，要降下甘露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"云彩要降下公义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地要裂开，萌生救恩和公义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是我耶和华创造的。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“跟造物主争辩的人有祸了！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他不过是世上瓦器中的一件。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陶泥怎能对陶匠说‘你在做什么’？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"受造之物怎能说‘造我的没手艺’？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"对父亲说‘你生的是什么’，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或对母亲说‘你产的是什么’的人有祸了！”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的圣者和创造主耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“你们就我子民将来的事质问我吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们发号施令要告诉我如何做吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我造了大地，又造了地上的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我亲手铺展穹苍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"布置天上的万象。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我凭公义使塞鲁士王兴起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要让他的道路畅通无阻。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必重建我的城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"释放我被掳的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不是为了得报酬或奖赏。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是万军之耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“埃及的出产和古实的货物必归你所有。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"身材高大的西巴人必来归附你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"戴着锁链跟在你身后。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们要向你下拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在你面前恳求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并说，‘上帝真的与你们同在，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂独一无二，除祂以外，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"别无他神。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"救主——以色列的上帝啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你真是一位隐藏自己的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"制造偶像的都必蒙羞受辱，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一同陷入耻辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但以色列必蒙耶和华拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"享受永远的救恩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"永远不会再蒙羞受辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"创造诸天、塑造和建立大地给人居住、没有使地荒凉的耶和华上帝说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我是独一无二的耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我没有在隐秘处暗暗地说话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我没有对雅各的后裔说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘你们徒然寻求我。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我耶和华宣扬真理，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"传讲正义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"“列国的幸存者啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要聚集到这里来。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那些抬着木头神像、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向不能救人的神明祷告的人真无知！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要陈明你们的理由，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要彼此商议。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁早已预言过这一切？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁很久以前就说过这些预言？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道不是我耶和华吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外别无他神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是公义的上帝，我是救主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外别无他神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"普世的人啊，归向我吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必蒙拯救，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我是独一无二的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我凭自己起誓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我口中的话真实可靠，绝不更改，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘万膝必向我跪拜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万口必起誓效忠于我。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘只有耶和华那里才有公义和能力。’”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向祂发怒的必在祂面前蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列的后裔必被耶和华称为义人，得到荣耀。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/45.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/46.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/44.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}